  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> are the solutions of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn></math>, then the least possible value of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is",
