  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br />So, equality should hold true if,<br /><math><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />For least value,&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
